OL,3,AUK says 'vital services' to continue in
OL,4,AEast Jerusalem as Israel says most
OL,5,Aconsulate diplomats leaving
OL,6,
OL,7,FMost diplomats will leave the British
OL,8,Fconsulate in occupied East Jerusalem,
OL,9,FIsrael says, but the UK insists the
OL,10,Fbuilding "will not be closing", and
OL,11,Fwill operate as a "UK Mission".
OL,13,F"We did not want it to come to this,"
OL,14,FIsraeli Foreign Minister Gideon Saar
OL,15,Fwrote on social media, as he said 20
OL,16,Fdiplomats and the consul general would
OL,17,Fleave Israel while a task force of
OL,18,Fseven could remain in the building
OL,19,F"with a very limited scope of
OL,20,Factivity".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
