OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK says 'vital services' to continue in
OL,4,AEast Jerusalem as Israel says most
OL,5,Aconsulate diplomats leaving
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband
OL,8,Fresponded that some staff had been
OL,9,F"temporarily withdrawn" for security
OL,10,Freasons, but stressed the mission will
OL,11,F"work with the Palestinian people".
OL,13,FIsrael said in September it would shut
OL,14,Fthe consulate, in retaliation for UK
OL,15,Fsanctions on Israeli settlements in the
OL,16,Foccupied West Bank which are illegal
OL,17,Funder international law.
